Project Description:
1.	Drilling of 40 appraisals, development or producer wells along with requisite well head production and processing facilities;
2.	Installation and commissioning of 4 Processing Facilities (Early Production System (EPS)/Gas Processing Unit (GPU)/Gas Gathering Station (GGS)) for production of Hydrocarbon (Gas, condensate and Crude Oil) from 5 existing wells and new wells upto 31 mmscfd of gas and / or 10,000 BOPD of Crude oil and /or condensate from each Processing Facility; and
3.	Installation and commissioning of flow pipelines (wells/well head to Processing Facilities) and export pipelines (Processing Facilities to GAIL SV station/other Gas Transportation Pipeline/end consumer)

